{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RADIOSOL</strong></h2> is a journey through a desolate world burned by a planetary cataclysm. In search of answers, you will have to navigate through the ruins of megastructures and abandoned cities, avoiding the scorching rays of the Sun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Why do my eyes hurt so much?</h2>Only concrete mountains block the Sun. It hurts my eyes so much. Night used to fall quickly in these man-made valleys. But not now.<br>When did this stop?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Why can\u2019t I hear other people\u2019s voices?</h2>I am the world's ear. I hear every radio station. I hear the hum of transistors, the boiling of mercury, and every rock on the visible side of the moon. But people don't talk anymore.<br>When did this stop?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Why do I have so many limbs?</h2>sagging - contraction - lengthening - emphasis<br>sagging - contraction - lengthening - emphasis<br>sagging - contraction - lengthening - emphasis<br>The Grove will be burned. Will I burn it?","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2934330?t=1746221011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2934330?t=1746221011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746221011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746221011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RADIOSOL</strong></h2> is a journey through a desolate world burned by a planetary cataclysm. In search of answers, you will have to navigate through the ruins of megastructures and abandoned cities, avoiding the scorching rays of the Sun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Why do my eyes hurt so much?</h2>Only concrete mountains block the Sun. It hurts my eyes so much. Night used to fall quickly in these man-made valleys. But not now.<br>When did this stop?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Why can\u2019t I hear other people\u2019s voices?</h2>I am the world's ear. I hear every radio station. I hear the hum of transistors, the boiling of mercury, and every rock on the visible side of the moon. But people don't talk anymore.<br>When did this stop?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Why do I have so many limbs?</h2>sagging - contraction - lengthening - emphasis<br>sagging - contraction - lengthening - emphasis<br>sagging - contraction - lengthening - emphasis<br>The Grove will be burned. Will I burn it?","developers":["TripletConcept"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934330/header.jpg?t=1746221011","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2934330/687178/8757a50a4464e2f212a55ac9ad7a1d109d41f602/1750890217/dash_av1.mpd?t=1713371463","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2934330/687178/8757a50a4464e2f212a55ac9ad7a1d109d41f602/1750890217/dash_h264.mpd?t=1713371463","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2934330/687178/8757a50a4464e2f212a55ac9ad7a1d109d41f602/1750890217/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1713371463","id":257015783,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257015783/movie480.mp4?t=1713371463","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257015783/movie_max.mp4?t=1713371463"},"name":"RADIOSOL","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257015783/movie.293x165.jp